<Text>&lt;font color="#000000" size=11&gt;

Other common &lt;i&gt;&lt;b&gt;List&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/i&gt; variations include the horizontal layout, grid layout, and single item chooser.
The &lt;i&gt;&lt;b&gt;List Items&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/i&gt; can also be used as &lt;i&gt;&lt;b&gt;Checkbox&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/i&gt; controls instead of standard &lt;i&gt;&lt;b&gt;Buttons&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/i&gt;.
Here are some more examples:

</Text>
</Properties>
